## What is happening (but shouldn't):
Negation pattern does not work properly with option `matchBase` in `micromatch@3.1.6`.

## Code
```
var mm = require('micromatch');   
mm.isMatch("./x/y.js", "*.js", { matchBase: true });    
// true    
mm.isMatch("./x/y.js", "!*.js", { matchBase: true });    
// true, but it should be false    
mm.isMatch("./x/y.js", "**/*.js", { matchBase: true });    
// true    
mm.isMatch("./x/y.js", "!**/*.js", { matchBase: true });    
// false    
```
